THE RAT: IFCOMP EDITION

There are two builds of the game included in this zip file.

web/ has the most user-friendly version, which can be played in a web browser; double-click index.html to start.

zmachine.z5 has a Z-machine version, for people who prefer to use a dedicated interpreter. This version doesn’t have hyperlinks, but can be played on all sorts of platforms.

If you run into any problems, ping @Draconis on the forums, or send an email to <dsdraco7@gmail.com>.

Have fun!
